(j)
procedure for redemption of shares by the cooperative society;
(k)
procedure for transfer or payment of interest on death of member;
(l)
the nature and extent of the liability of the members for the debts contracted by the cooperative society;
(m)
the nature and extent of the liability of the Directors for the debts contracted by the cooperative society;
(n)
the manner of disposal of funds if under liquidation.
